Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:16:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] perf(render): skip idle show block entity renders

render() draws nothing and changes no state unless one of the frame/axis/text counters is active, so return false from shouldRender in that case to skip the dispatcher's per-frame light lookup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
---
